    "name": "No One Leaves the Field",
    "steam_appid": 3652690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.poster.avif?t=1752587705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.webm?t=1752587705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.mp4?t=1752587705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No One Leaves the Field is a first-person horror game set in a cursed, ever-shifting wheat field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After swerving to avoid a dog on a lonely country road, you wake to find your car wrecked, your keys missing, and towering wheat stretching in every direction. The wind carries whispers. Shapes move just beyond the edge of your flashlight. You are not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a flickering light and your instincts, you must navigate the maze, uncover strange landmarks, and search for a way out. But be warned: the wheat does not like to be disturbed. Step off the path, and something will come for you. Something old. Something watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/edc14d7c3fff28b0ecdb4bc0ee6676e9.avif?t=1752587705\" width=600 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits in the Field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e A Maze That Changes Every Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wheatfield twists and reshapes itself. No two escapes are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A Scarecrow That Hunts in Silence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't run. It doesn't speak. It only watches\u2014and waits for you to make a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Only Your Flashlight and Your Wits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what little light you have to navigate the dark. Drop markers to track where you've been\u2014before you forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Unearth Lost Places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empty barn. A broken-down farmhouse. A well that shouldn't be that deep. Clues are out there\u2014if you dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/bd6b14fb755e9cb8797f59d5eb0d89cc.avif?t=1752587705\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/7a07f0d3cc42c777d6a081e74bf9ca92.avif?t=1752587705\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.poster.avif?t=1752587705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.webm?t=1752587705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.mp4?t=1752587705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No One Leaves the Field is a first-person horror game set in a cursed, ever-shifting wheat field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After swerving to avoid a dog on a lonely country road, you wake to find your car wrecked, your keys missing, and towering wheat stretching in every direction. The wind carries whispers. Shapes move just beyond the edge of your flashlight. You are not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a flickering light and your instincts, you must navigate the maze, uncover strange landmarks, and search for a way out. But be warned: the wheat does not like to be disturbed. Step off the path, and something will come for you. Something old. Something watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/edc14d7c3fff28b0ecdb4bc0ee6676e9.avif?t=1752587705\" width=600 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits in the Field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e A Maze That Changes Every Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wheatfield twists and reshapes itself. No two escapes are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A Scarecrow That Hunts in Silence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't run. It doesn't speak. It only watches\u2014and waits for you to make a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Only Your Flashlight and Your Wits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what little light you have to navigate the dark. Drop markers to track where you've been\u2014before you forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Unearth Lost Places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empty barn. A broken-down farmhouse. A well that shouldn't be that deep. Clues are out there\u2014if you dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/bd6b14fb755e9cb8797f59d5eb0d89cc.avif?t=1752587705\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/7a07f0d3cc42c777d6a081e74bf9ca92.avif?t=1752587705\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p>",
